# Per-Dockerfile ignore for `docker build -f mayhem/Dockerfile` (BuildKit gives this file
# precedence over a context-root .dockerignore, which this repo doesn't have). Keeps stray
# LOCAL build artifacts (cargo-fuzz's own target/ dirs, produced by iterating on this port
# outside the image) out of the build context -- they're already covered by mayhem/.gitignore
# so never get committed, but an uncommitted leftover would otherwise still get COPY'd into
# the image and can trip the "no baked-in ASan option overrides" check with a stale prebuilt
# binary. Keep .git (the grader needs full history) and every source/test/fixture file.
mayhem/fuzz/target
rust/**/target
target
